---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Sewing Machines - Soft Goods - DES4800"
  description="Sewing machine basics for product design soft-goods studio work."
>
  <article class="post-detail">
    <header class="post-header">
      <a href="/soft-goods/" class="back-link">← Back to Soft Goods</a>
      <h1>Sewing Machines</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        Sewing machines turn cut parts into sewn assemblies. Studio work depends on setup, needle and stitch choice, and
        safe operation as much as on pattern design. This page will expand with machine types, setup checklists, and
        prototype-friendly techniques.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
